{"id":"42b817f141b6851c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-omega-rule.md","title":"Omega-rule","display":"df-omega-rule — Omega-rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-omega-rule","aliases":["72-df-omega-rule"],"display":"df-omega-rule — Omega-rule","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1 and Figure1 print164–166/PDF176–178; Ch.IV §1.1 print210/PDF222 (ordinal background only); local two-sided presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_2026_10_22":"明确ω规则的前提函数和整体结论，固定四元实例元数"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-omega-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-omega-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-rule — Omega-rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1 and Figure1 print164–166/PDF176–178; Ch.IV §1.1 print210/PDF222 (ordinal background only); local two-sided presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"明确ω规则的前提函数和整体结论，固定四元实例元数"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-omega-rule-—-omega-rule\">df-omega-rule — omega-rule</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in C\">\\(0\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in F\">\\(s\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(s)=1\">\\(a_F(s)=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline0:=0\">\\(\\overline0:=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}:=s(\\overline n)\">\\(\\overline{n+1}:=s(\\overline n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\mathsf{\\omega R},\\langle x,A\\rangle,\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\mathsf{\\omega R},\\langle x,A\\rangle,\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全部标准数码项闭合，因而自由代入条件自动满足；签名现明确含0和一元后继。ω条前提是以ω为域的函数，既非无序集合也非有限序列。</p>\n<p>本次复核第 III 章 §3.1 的语言、判断及 Figure 1，印刷 pp.164–166 / PDF pp.176–178。原书使用单侧有限公式集及参数判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:\\mathbb N\\vdash^\\alpha\\Delta\">\\(n:\\mathbb N\\vdash^\\alpha\\Delta\\)</span>，全称规则还带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_m\\in\\alpha[\\max(n,m)]\">\\(\\beta_m\\in\\alpha[\\max(n,m)]\\)</span> 的序数约束。本文件只抽取全称量化的可数前提结构，改用双侧序列并显式保存规则标签和见证；它没有定义原书的完整带界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-算术。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：将每个前提相继式与结论相继式整体括起，明确带标签对象恰有四个分量；语境的逗号是序列串接，不是额外元组分量。全部数码仍由同一指定0与后继符号生成。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-omega-rule-—-omega-rule","text":"df-omega-rule — omega-rule","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名；$X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$，$A,B$ 遍历 $X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列以自然数为定义域，$\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}$；$\\Gamma,A$ 缩写 $\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle$，$A,\\Gamma$ 缩写 $\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma$。多个逗号按次序串接。$\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的语法有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；$\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle$，$\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle$，见 [[72-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"a_F(s)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline0:=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}:=s(\\overline n)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma:=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\mathsf{\\omega R},\\langle x,A\\rangle,\n\\bigl((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A[\\overline n/x])\\bigr)_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\forall xA)\\right\\rangle:\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ x\\in V\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"n:\\mathbb N\\vdash^\\alpha\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_m\\in\\alpha[\\max(n,m)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3040,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d84a32e163edd84","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}$ 是加入公理初始式的演算；$\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}$ 再加入 [[72-df-omega-rule]] 的完整带标签规则集。"},{"id":"80e1d458af53fea9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 为给定五元签名，并指定 $0\\in C$、$s\\in F$、$a_F(s)=1$，供 [[72-df-omega-rule]] 构造全部数码。$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 为 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的演算，$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；对任意此类演算 $\\mathcal D$，$\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal D}$ 是该文件定义的良基证明树集合。"},{"id":"9ba5875c85771b52","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[72-df-omega-rule]] 的数码、签名与 $x\\in V$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-omega-rule|df-omega-rule — Omega-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","3c073b947b255638"]}